Subject: [PATCH 7/7] tests/nnrpd: Ignore the generated auth helper in source
 tarballs

Keep the no-Git fallback ignore list in mkmanifest aligned with
.gitignore. Otherwise the generated nnrpd/auth-test is reported as an
unexpected source file by make check-manifest in release and CI tarballs.

Co-Authored-By: GPT-6.1 Sol <noreply@openai.com>
---
 support/mkmanifest | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/support/mkmanifest b/support/mkmanifest
index e7bc56cbd..d3a4b4972 100755
--- a/support/mkmanifest
+++ b/support/mkmanifest
@@ -341,6 +341,7 @@ tests/lib/wire.t
 tests/lib/xmalloc
 tests/lib/xwrite.t
 tests/nnrpd/auth-ext.t
+tests/nnrpd/auth-test
 tests/overview/api.t
 tests/overview/buffindexed.t
 tests/overview/ovsqlite.t
